Use in ZeroJ
------------

Test data only: known-answer and negative tests in zeroj-circuit-lib (for example
HpkeKnownAnswerTest, ConfidentialNoteKnownAnswerTest and the SHA-2 tests) read these files. They are test
resources, so they are in no published ZeroJ artifact.
